-## Robot / Joint Mapping
-
-当前 velocity 任务使用：
-
-```python
-ACTIVE_JOINTS = [
-    "FL_thigh", "FL_calf",
-    "FR_thigh", "FR_calf",
-    "RL_thigh", "RL_calf",
-    "RR_thigh", "RR_calf",
-]
