-## URDF Body / Joint Names
-
-URDF 中 link 名称包括：
-
-```text
-base
-FL_thigh, FL_calf, FL_3, FL_1, FL_2
-FR_thigh, FR_calf, FR_3, FR_1, FR_2
-RL_thigh, RL_calf, RL_3, RL_1, RL_2
-RR_thigh, RR_calf, RR_3, RR_1, RR_2
