-
-Bennett rough 覆盖：
-
-- `feet_air_time.body_names = ".*_1"`
-- `feet_air_time.weight = 0.01`
-- `undesired_contacts = None`
-- `dof_torques_l2.weight = -0.0002`
-- `track_lin_vel_xy_exp.weight = 1.5`
