-# 16. 推荐实验消融
-
-每次只改变一项：
-
-```text
-A0：普通 velocity baseline
-A1：+ gait phase observation
-A2：+ desired contact schedule
-A3：+ contact matching rewards
-A4：+ support margin
-A5：+ slip and touchdown rewards
-A6：+ observation history
-A7：+ measured latency
-A8：+ actuator model
-A9：+ calibrated domain randomization
